Source: fractalsql-postgresql
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: FractalSQLabs
Build-Depends:
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 gcc,
 g++,
 libpq-dev,
 libssl-dev,
 pkg-config,
 postgresql-server-dev-all
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/FractalSQLabs/fractalsql-postgresql

Package: postgresql-14-fractalsql
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 libc6 (>= 2.34),
 libcurl4,
 libssl3,
 postgresql-14
Description: Stochastic Fractal Search extension for PostgreSQL 14
 FractalSQL registers a pure-C Stochastic Fractal Search optimizer
 (fractal_search()/fractal_search_explore()) plus the full Discovery/
 Cognition/Text-to-SQL/Agency/Analytics/Enterprise tier surface (see
 docs/features.md), including the dependent fractalsql_agents
 extension's sixteen installable agents. Optional LLM reasoning plugin
 (fractalsql-reasoning-http, which links libcurl). Also ships the
 fractalsql-postgresql-mcp MCP (Model Context Protocol) JSON-RPC server
 (in the PG libdir, alongside the extension .so) exposing the same
 surface as one-tool-per-function for external agent clients over stdio
 or an optional TLS / Bearer-token-authenticated HTTP transport -- see
 the package doc dir's mcp/README.md. This binary is
 compiled against the PostgreSQL 14 server ABI.

